sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Admin / Editor
    actor KH as Khách (token portal)
    participant UI as TaskCommentColumn (task drawer)
    participant Portal as SharePortalClient (/share/[token])
    participant TCA as task-comment-actions.ts
    participant SPA as share-portal-actions.ts
    participant SEC as security.verifyWorkspaceAccess
    participant SLA as share-link-auth.resolveShareToken
    participant DB as Prisma / Neon
    participant NOTI as notification-actions + broadcast

    Note over Staff, DB: Chiều 1 — staff bình luận INTERNAL/CLIENT
    Staff->>UI: mở task detail (TaskDetailRoute)
    UI->>TCA: getTaskActivityFeed(taskId, workspaceId)
    TCA->>SEC: staffCtx gọi verifyWorkspaceAccess(MEMBER)
    alt không session / account LOCKED / sessionVersion cũ
        SEC-->>TCA: throw SECURITY_VIOLATION
        TCA-->>UI: lỗi (UI giữ feed cũ)
    else hợp lệ
        SEC-->>TCA: userId + isAdmin
        TCA->>DB: taskComment.findMany(isDeleted=false) + auditLog(EVENT_LABELS) + reactions
        DB-->>TCA: comments + events
        TCA-->>UI: TaskFeedItem[] (cả INTERNAL lẫn CLIENT)
        UI->>TCA: markTaskCommentsRead upsert TaskCommentReadState
    end

    Staff->>UI: gõ bình luận + chọn visibility
    UI->>TCA: createTaskComment(taskId, workspaceId, body visibility parentId)
    TCA->>SEC: staffCtx
    TCA->>DB: taskInWorkspace(taskId, workspaceId)
    alt task không thuộc workspace
        TCA-->>UI: success=false Không tìm thấy task
    else body rỗng sau sanitizeClientText
        TCA-->>UI: success=false Nội dung trống
    else parentId không tồn tại hoặc đã xoá
        TCA-->>UI: success=false Bình luận gốc không tồn tại
    else hợp lệ
        TCA->>TCA: resolveMentions(body) qua buildTaskMentionUsers
        TCA->>DB: taskComment.create(authorType=STAFF, visibility, mentions)
        opt visibility = INTERNAL
            TCA->>DB: lọc bỏ target là CLIENT account (fix HT-026)
        end
        loop mỗi userId được mention (khác tác giả)
            TCA->>NOTI: createNotificationInternal(TASK_COMMENT) + broadcastNotificationToUser
            Note right of NOTI: lỗi notify chỉ console.error, comment vẫn thành công
        end
        TCA->>NOTI: broadcastFeedChanged broadcastToTopic(FEED_CHANGED)
        TCA->>DB: audit task.comment_added
        TCA-->>UI: success=true id createdAt
        NOTI-->>UI: realtime FEED_CHANGED, drawer khác refetch feed
    end

    Note over KH, DB: Chiều 2 — khách bình luận qua token (F09)
    KH->>Portal: gõ tin nhắn trong /share/[token]
    Portal->>SPA: postCommentViaToken(token, taskId, body, parentId)
    SPA->>SLA: resolveShareToken(token)
    alt token sai / revoked / hết hạn
        SPA-->>Portal: success=false This link is invalid
    else quá rate limit 30 msg mỗi giờ
        SPA-->>Portal: success=false Too many messages
    else task ngoài scope token (findScopedTask null)
        SPA-->>Portal: success=false link invalid or item no longer exists
    else body rỗng
        SPA-->>Portal: success=false Please write a message
    else parent không phải comment CLIENT còn sống
        SPA-->>Portal: success=false comment replied to no longer exists
    else hợp lệ
        SPA->>DB: taskComment.create(authorType=CLIENT, visibility ép = CLIENT)
        alt DB create lỗi
            SPA-->>Portal: success=false Could not post your comment
        else tạo thành công
            SPA->>NOTI: notify Manager (task.assignedById) TASK_COMMENT
            SPA->>DB: audit task.comment_added (via share_link + ip)
            SPA-->>Portal: success=true id createdAt
        end
    end

    KH->>Portal: xem feed
    Portal->>SPA: getCommentFeedViaToken(token, taskId)
    SPA->>SLA: resolveShareToken + findScopedTask
    alt token hoặc task ngoài scope
        SPA-->>Portal: [] (feed rỗng)
    else hợp lệ
        SPA->>DB: findMany(visibility=CLIENT, isDeleted=false) — INTERNAL bị lọc cứng
        SPA-->>Portal: ClientFeedItem[] (staff ẩn danh The team, khách là You)
    end

